{"title":"Career Roadmap: Export-Import Executive","role":"Export-Import Executive","summary":"An Export-Import Executive manages the operational and documentation side of international trade. The role involves coordinating export/import orders, commercial documents, shipping, customs, freight forwarders, banks, suppliers, buyers and logistics providers.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com - Foreign Trade / International Business"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build expertise in export-import documentation, trade compliance, logistics, customs, payments and international business"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Export-Import Executive manages the operational and documentation side of international trade. The role involves coordinating export/import orders, commercial documents, shipping, customs, freight forwarders, banks, suppliers, buyers and logistics providers."},{"type":"p","text":"The professional should understand the complete trade cycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Buyer/Seller","Purchase/Sales Contract","Documentation","Logistics","Customs","Shipment","Banking/Payment","Delivery","Compliance"]},{"type":"p","text":"The role is highly process-oriented, so accuracy, documentation, international trade regulations, communication and coordination are critical."}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof of Skill","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Commerce & business fundamentals"},{"text":"Accounting, economics, business law"},{"text":"International business case study"},{"text":"Weak commercial fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"International trade fundamentals"},{"text":"Export/import procedures, Incoterms, documentation"},{"text":"Complete simulated trade file"},{"text":"Memorizing terms without understanding workflow"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Trade operations & compliance"},{"text":"Customs, logistics, banking, DGFT concepts"},{"text":"Export-import project"},{"text":"Documentation errors"}],[{"text":"Final Stage"},{"text":"Industry readiness"},{"text":"ERP, Excel, freight/logistics systems, internship"},{"text":"Trade documentation portfolio + internship"},{"text":"Lack of practical exposure"}]]}]},{"heading":"Semester-by-Semester Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Semester 1"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial Accounting"},{"text":"Business Economics"},{"text":"Business Communication"},{"text":"Business Law"},{"text":"Excel fundamentals"},{"text":"Introduction to international business"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 2"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"International Trade"},{"text":"Business Statistics"},{"text":"Banking fundamentals"},{"text":"Commercial documentation"},{"text":"Foreign exchange fundamentals"},{"text":"International markets"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 3"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Export procedures"},{"text":"Import procedures"},{"text":"Trade documentation"},{"text":"Incoterms"},{"text":"International contracts"},{"text":"Export pricing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 4"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customs procedures"},{"text":"Freight forwarding"},{"text":"Shipping operations"},{"text":"Ports and logistics"},{"text":"Cargo insurance"},{"text":"HS classification fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 5"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Foreign exchange"},{"text":"International payments"},{"text":"Letters of Credit"},{"text":"Documentary collections"},{"text":"Trade finance"},{"text":"DGFT/compliance concepts"},{"text":"ERP and trade-management systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 6"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Export-import compliance"},{"text":"Supply-chain coordination"},{"text":"Trade analytics"},{"text":"Risk management"},{"text":"Internship"},{"text":"End-to-end export-import capstone"}]}]},{"heading":"Export-Import Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand the complete international trade process."},{"type":"h","text":"Export Flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Buyer Inquiry","Quotation","Purchase Order/Contract","Production/Procurement","Documentation","Packing","Freight Booking","Customs Clearance","Shipment","Documents","Payment","Delivery"]},{"type":"h","text":"Import Flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Supplier Selection","Purchase Order","Contract","Shipping","Import Documentation","Customs Clearance","Duties/Taxes","Delivery","Payment/Reconciliation"]}]},{"heading":"Important Trade Documents","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn the purpose and preparation of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Commercial Documents"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Proforma Invoice"},{"text":"Commercial Invoice"},{"text":"Packing List"},{"text":"Purchase Order"},{"text":"Sales Contract"},{"text":"Certificate of Origin"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Transport Documents"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bill of Lading"},{"text":"Air Waybill"},{"text":"Shipping Bill"},{"text":"Bill of Entry"},{"text":"Delivery Order"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Banking Documents"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Letter of Credit"},{"text":"Bill of Exchange"},{"text":"Documentary Collection"},{"text":"Bank remittance documents"},{"text":"Payment instructions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance Documents"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Import/export declarations"},{"text":"Insurance documents"},{"text":"Inspection certificates"},{"text":"Product-specific certificates"},{"text":"Regulatory permits where applicable"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact documents vary by product, country, transport mode and trade arrangement."}]},{"heading":"Incoterms","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Incoterms are essential for an Export-Import Executive."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EXW"},{"text":"FCA"},{"text":"FAS"},{"text":"FOB"},{"text":"CFR"},{"text":"CIF"},{"text":"CPT"},{"text":"CIP"},{"text":"DAP"},{"text":"DPU"},{"text":"DDP"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For each term, understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Seller responsibility"},{"text":"Buyer responsibility"},{"text":"Transportation cost"},{"text":"Insurance responsibility"},{"text":"Risk transfer"},{"text":"Export clearance"},{"text":"Import clearance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important"},{"type":"p","text":"Do not memorize Incoterms only by abbreviation. Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Who pays?","Who arranges?","Where does risk transfer?"]}]},{"heading":"International Trade Pricing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to calculate an export/import price."},{"type":"p","text":"Consider:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product cost"},{"text":"Packaging"},{"text":"Inland transportation"},{"text":"Freight"},{"text":"Insurance"},{"text":"Customs duties"},{"text":"Handling charges"},{"text":"Port charges"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Bank charges"},{"text":"Agent commission"},{"text":"Exchange-rate impact"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Example Pricing Flow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product Cost","Packaging","Inland Freight","Export Costs","International Freight","Insurance","Import Costs","Landed Cost"]}]},{"heading":"Customs Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customs declaration"},{"text":"Import clearance"},{"text":"Export clearance"},{"text":"Customs valuation"},{"text":"HS classification"},{"text":"Customs duties"},{"text":"Import taxes"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Examination"},{"text":"Risk management"},{"text":"Clearance process"}]},{"type":"h","text":"HS Code"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how products are classified using the Harmonized System and why correct classification affects:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Duties"},{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Restrictions"},{"text":"Trade statistics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Actual classification should be verified against the applicable tariff and customs rules for the product and destination."}]},{"heading":"DGFT & Indian Trade Ecosystem","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For an India-focused career, understand the roles of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DGFT"},{"text":"Indian Customs"},{"text":"RBI"},{"text":"Banks"},{"text":"Ports"},{"text":"Freight forwarders"},{"text":"Shipping lines"},{"text":"Air cargo operators"},{"text":"Export Promotion Councils"},{"text":"Insurance providers"},{"text":"Logistics companies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the purpose of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"IEC"},{"text":"Export/import authorizations where applicable"},{"text":"Trade documentation"},{"text":"Foreign trade policy"},{"text":"Export incentives/remission concepts"},{"text":"Regulatory compliance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Current procedures, schemes and requirements can change, so operational work should always be checked against the latest official requirements."}]},{"heading":"Foreign Exchange & Trade Finance","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Exchange rates"},{"text":"Currency conversion"},{"text":"Exchange-rate risk"},{"text":"Forward contracts"},{"text":"International remittances"},{"text":"Trade credit"},{"text":"Working capital"},{"text":"Bank charges"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Payment Methods"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advance payment"},{"text":"Open account"},{"text":"Documentary collection"},{"text":"Letter of Credit"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the relative:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Buyer risk"},{"text":"Seller risk"},{"text":"Bank involvement"},{"text":"Documentation requirements"},{"text":"Payment security"}]}]},{"heading":"Letter of Credit","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn the basic LC workflow:"},{"type":"flow","item