ctions"},{"text":"Sanctions/export-control concepts"},{"text":"Restricted goods"},{"text":"Documentation requirements"},{"text":"Origin requirements"},{"text":"Product certifications"},{"text":"Dual-use goods concepts"},{"text":"Customer/supplier due diligence"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The exact compliance requirements depend on the product, origin, destination and transaction structure."}]},{"heading":"Excel & Data Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Excel is essential for export-import operations."},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SUM"},{"text":"IF"},{"text":"IFS"},{"text":"IFERROR"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"COUNTIFS"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"PivotTables"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Power Query"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical Applications"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Shipment tracker"},{"text":"Purchase-order tracker"},{"text":"Export documentation tracker"},{"text":"Container tracker"},{"text":"Freight-cost calculator"},{"text":"Landed-cost calculator"},{"text":"Payment tracker"},{"text":"Customer/order dashboard"}]}]},{"heading":"ERP & Trade Technology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SAP"},{"text":"Oracle ERP"},{"text":"Microsoft Dynamics"},{"text":"Tally/SME accounting systems"},{"text":"Trade-management platforms"},{"text":"Logistics-management systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"ERP Concepts"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sales orders"},{"text":"Purchase orders"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Vendor management"},{"text":"Customer management"},{"text":"Invoicing"},{"text":"Shipping"},{"text":"Financial accounting"},{"text":"Foreign currency transactions"},{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Supply-chain workflows"}]}]},{"heading":"International Business Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[